# Halcyon CODEOWNERS
#
# Why: Ensures the right reviewers are automatically requested for sensitive paths.
# Who: GitHub uses this on every PR to assign reviewers.
# Standard: Changes to owned paths require approval from listed owners before merge.
#
# Syntax: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owners for the entire repository
*                                   @halcyon-io/core

# Constitution and governance (require maintainer review)
/README.md                          @halcyon-io/core
/ARCHITECTURE.md                    @halcyon-io/architecture
/SYSTEM_DESIGN.md                   @halcyon-io/architecture
/CONTRIBUTING.md                    @halcyon-io/core
/SECURITY.md                        @halcyon-io/security
/RELEASE_PROCESS.md                 @halcyon-io/core
/ROADMAP.md                         @halcyon-io/core

# Contracts (schema changes affect all consumers)
/contracts/                         @halcyon-io/architecture @halcyon-io/core

# ADRs and RFCs
/docs/adr/                          @halcyon-io/architecture
/docs/rfc/                          @halcyon-io/architecture

# Security documentation and threat model
/docs/security/                     @halcyon-io/security

# Platform shared libraries (high blast radius)
/pkg/platform/                      @halcyon-io/platform

# Infrastructure and deployment
/infra/                             @halcyon-io/infra
/deploy/                            @halcyon-io/infra

# CI/CD workflows
/.github/workflows/                 @halcyon-io/infra @halcyon-io/core

# Service ownership (update as team grows)
/services/auth/                     @halcyon-io/platform
/services/gateway/                  @halcyon-io/platform
/services/ingestion/                @halcyon-io/ingestion
/services/correlation/              @halcyon-io/ingestion
/services/workflow/                 @halcyon-io/workflow
/services/ai/                       @halcyon-io/ai @halcyon-io/security
/services/audit/                    @halcyon-io/security
